{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o164a","title":"大风江海涌溢高陵树拔城门飞落","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o164a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"大风江海涌溢高陵树拔城门飞落","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o164a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":251,"label":"八月朔","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y251","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o162","basis":"八月朔"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o164a-q","wuzhu-q-o162","houfei-q-o030","shaodi-q-o048","shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o164a-q","source_order":[47,812,"O164a"],"order":8412}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o030","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-3246574a0401a9de5d60","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平三年正月，畅薨，追赠车骑将军，谥曰恭侯。子绍嗣。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：嘉平三年（公元 251）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-563b7a630850bbcc0541","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o048","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o164a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-237578b1fcff91b6d65b","layer":"original","quote":"八月朔，大风；江海涌溢，平地深八尺；吴高陵松柏斯拔〖6〗，郡城南门飞落〖7〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o162","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-671499ac1e4476e8a616","layer":"original","quote":"太元元年夏五月，立皇后潘氏〖1〗。大赦，改年。初，临海罗阳县有神〖2〗，自称王表；﹝一﹞周旋民间，语言饮食，与人无异，然不见其形。又有一婢，名纺绩。是月，遣中书郎李崇，赍辅国将军、罗阳王印绶，迎表〖3〗。表随崇俱出，与崇及所在郡守、令长谈论，崇等无以易〖4〗。所历山川，辄遣婢与其神相闻。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":144}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
